    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LoFi Golf</strong> is a chill, third-person, physics-based golf game set to relaxing LoFi music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to complete five maps using the limited number of shots available. Choose your preferred difficulty level, explore atmospheric maps, and build your strategy to succeed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skills in Training Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711030/extras/2a194d02fb494e56a4ca126728069b1f.poster.avif?t=1752759714\" width=420 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711030/extras/2a194d02fb494e56a4ca126728069b1f.webm?t=1752759714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711030/extras/2a194d02fb494e56a4ca126728069b1f.mp4?t=1752759714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you complete a map, progress to the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711030/extras/78d4b97b30cdecdd77d7c1b565f48346.poster.avif?t=1752759714\" width=420 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711030/extras/78d4b97b30cdecdd77d7c1b565f48346.webm?t=1752759714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711030/extras/78d4b97b30cdecdd77d7c1b565f48346.mp4?t=1752759714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy highly interactive environments full of creative paths and surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711030/extras/4d2d1afc7b7d0f0804a40173099cf6df.poster.avif?t=1752759714\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711030/extras/4d2d1afc7b7d0f0804a40173099cf6df.webm?t=1752759714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711030/extras/4d2d1afc7b7d0f0804a40173099cf6df.mp4?t=1752759714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LoFi Golf</strong> is a chill, third-person, physics-based golf game set to relaxing LoFi music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to complete five maps using the limited number of shots available. Choose your preferred difficulty level, explore atmospheric maps, and build your strategy to succeed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skills in Training Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711030/extras/2a194d02fb494e56a4ca126728069b1f.poster.avif?t=1752759714\" width=420 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711030/extras/2a194d02fb494e56a4ca126728069b1f.webm?t=1752759714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711030/extras/2a194d02fb494e56a4ca126728069b1f.mp4?t=1752759714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you complete a map, progress to the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711030/extras/78d4b97b30cdecdd77d7c1b565f48346.poster.avif?t=1752759714\" width=420 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711030/extras/78d4b97b30cdecdd77d7c1b565f48346.webm?t=1752759714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711030/extras/78d4b97b30cdecdd77d7c1b565f48346.mp4?t=1752759714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy highly interactive environments full of creative paths and surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711030/extras/4d2d1afc7b7d0f0804a40173099cf6df.poster.avif?t=1752759714\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711030/extras/4d2d1afc7b7d0f0804a40173099cf6df.webm?t=1752759714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711030/extras/4d2d1afc7b7d0f0804a40173099cf6df.mp4?t=1752759714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Chill out with a third-person, physics-based golf game set to relaxing LoFi music.\u00a0 Explore dreamy, atmospheric maps with the freedom to find your own path. Will you risk a tricky shortcut or play it safe? Every shot counts, complete each course before running out of strokes!",
